ices\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-6\",\n   \"text\": \"Provide staff with operational order queues and delivery information\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-7\",\n   \"text\": \"Provide management with basic sales and product reporting\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-8\",\n   \"text\": \"Maintain an auditable history of orders, invoices, customer accounts, and catalogue changes\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-9\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement customer authentication with sign-in, password reset, and account management\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-10\",\n   \"text\": \"Build product catalogue with search, filtering, categories, and vehicle compatibility\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-11\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement customer-specific pricing and price list management\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-12\",\n   \"text\": \"Manage stock availability with ERP CSV imports\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-13\",\n   \"text\": \"Build basket and checkout workflow with delivery date rules\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-14\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement order management with status tracking and staff editing capabilities\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-15\",\n   \"text\": \"Build customer order history, cancellation, and repeat order functionality\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-16\",\n   \"text\": \"Implement invoice creation, viewing, PDF download, and payment tracking\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"id\": \"I-17\",\n   \"text\": \"Build administrative tools for product, user, category, and price list management\"\n  }\n ],\n \"touchesUi\": true\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"Is the Customer Account Manager role part of the first release?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Build the role model so Account Manager can be added later, but don't expose it now\",\n  \"by\": \"ASM-1,ASM-2,ASM-3,ASM-4,ASM-5 (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Should a Buyer see every order and invoice for their company, or only the orders they placed 