\"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Are saved basket templates (section 16) in scope? They are listed for Buyers but missing from the intent list. → assumed: Out of scope for this release\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-17\",\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Who maintains customer company records (name, account number, billing address, addresses, active status): Office Staff, Administrators, or both? → assumed: Administrators only; staff can view\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How is 'low stock' decided, and is the threshold fixed or configurable? → assumed: One global quantity threshold, configurable by admin in system settings\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"If an out-of-stock product (or a quantity above stock) is in the basket, what happens? → assumed: The product can't be added and checkout is blocked until the line is reduced or removed\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-11\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-5\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"If a product has no price on the customer's assigned price list, how is it shown? → assumed: Shown with 'price on request' and cannot be added to the basket\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-9\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-6\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Are prices tax-exclusive or tax-inclusive, and do invoices show tax? → assumed: Prices are net (tax-exclusive) with one configurable tax rate added on invoices\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-11\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-7\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How does the nightly ERP CSV reach the portal, and what are its columns? → assumed: The scheduled job reads the file from a configured folder or SFTP location in an agreed column format (product code, quantity)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-12\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-12\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-8\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"If the ERP CSV contains product identifiers the portal doesn't know, or a product is missing from the file, what happens? → assumed: Unknown rows are skipped and reported; products missing from the file keep their previous stock\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-13\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-9\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Are the 14:00 cutoff, the non-working days and the timezone fixed or configurable, and how are public holidays handled? → assumed: Cutoff, timezone, weekly non-working days and a list of holiday dates all set by admin in system settings\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\",\n   \"I-4\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-10\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Does the cutoff rule apply to staff-created orders too, or can staff choose any date? → assumed: The same cutoff rule applies to staff-created orders\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-11\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Which status transitions can staff make after confirmation? Can they skip steps or go back, and can they cancel a Confirmed or Picking order? → assumed: Forward one step at a time only; staff can cancel any order up to Out for delivery\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-16\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-12\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Should a rejected order use a separate Rejected status, or become Cancelled with a reason? → assumed: Cancelled, with the rejection reason recorded\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-17\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\