d: One configured business timezone, with admins keeping a list of non-working dates (public holidays included) as well as weekends\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-14\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-38\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How far ahead can a customer choose a delivery date? → assumed: Any working day from the earliest available date up to a configurable number of days ahead (e.g. 30)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-15\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-39\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Do prices include tax, and do order and invoice totals show tax? → assumed: Prices are entered and shown excluding tax; no tax is calculated in this phase\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-17\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-13\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-40\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Should a basket be kept between sign-ins? → assumed: Yes: one saved basket per user, kept until checkout or cleared\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-19\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-41\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should staff rejections be recorded? → assumed: Use Cancelled status with a required rejection reason, marked as staff-rejected in the timeline\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-20\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\",\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-42\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Who gets order emails (confirmation, amendment, rejection, out for delivery), including for orders staff create? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-21\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-14\",\n   \"I-16\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-43\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How are order and invoice numbers formatted? → assumed: Separate sequential numbers with a configurable prefix (e.g. ORD-000123, INV-000123)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-22\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-11\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-44\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"An admin deactivates a price list that customers are still assigned to. What happens? → assumed: Block deactivation while any active customer is assigned to it\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"roles\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-24\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-6\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-45\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"Can Administrators also do everything Office Staff can (order queue, confirming orders, invoices)? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-25\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-46\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should password reset links and invitations expire, and can invitations be resent? → assumed: Reset link valid 1 hour, invitation 7 days (both configurable); admins can resend, which cancels the earlier invitation\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-26\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-9\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-47\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Can a user whose account is locked request a password reset, and does completing the reset unlock the account? → assumed: Yes: they can request a reset, and completing it clears the lock\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-27\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-17\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-48\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Do categories need to be nested? → assumed: One flat level of categories\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-28\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-10\",\n   \"I-2\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-49\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Where does vehicle compatibility data come from? → assumed: Admins enter it by hand for each product (make/model/year/engine/variant)\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"search\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-29\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-10\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-50\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should catalogue search match and rank results? → assumed: Search by name or title with simple filters; no full-text search engine.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-30\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-7\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-51\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"What should the basic sales and product reports contain? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-31\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-52\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which orders go into 'the day's delivery list' export? → assumed: Orders with today's delivery date (or a chosen date) in Confirmed, Picking or Out for delivery status\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"languages\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q-32\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-53\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"Which languages and currency does the portal support? → assumed: English only, left to right.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"cb\" kind=\"current-behaviour\" sha=\"\">\n{\n \"claims\": [],\n \"header\": {\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-04T18:03:26.331Z\",\n  \"inputsHash\": \"\",\n  \"kind\": \"current-behaviour\",\n  \"producedBy\": {\n   \"stage\": \"ground\"\n  },\n  \"runId\": \"20261004-automotive-parts-customer-orde-ca25\",\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1\n },\n \"notFound\": [\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-1\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-2\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-3\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-4\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-5\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"searched\": [\n    \"no repository: this is n